t3term source adaptations (0.7 terminal workspace)

adapter/activity.mjs ports and adapts tool_argument, output_text, tool_output
and describe_as from krishhgg/t3term src/transcript.rs at
d1d33e89ae16dd09a4ff1e2a9f1570b3416a0c1e. The bounded lazy result inspector
also follows src/client.rs::turn_item and src/tui/mod.rs::Outputs.
internal/ui/navigator.go and workspace_layout.go adapt the responsive column,
sidebar width, focus cycle and context-pane composition in src/tui/mod.rs
and src/tui/details.rs from that same revision.

The adapted code uses t3oxide's source-qualified identities, exact operation
recovery, bounded history and existing themes. No Rust runtime, full T3
projector or t3term account-switching policy is bundled.
